{"speciesId":24,"names":{"fr":"Arbok","es":"Arbok","en":"Arbok","ja":"アーボック"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It is rumored that the ferocious warning markings on its belly differ from area to area."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It is rumored that the ferocious warning markings on its belly differ from area to area."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The frightening patterns on its belly have been studied. Six variations have been confirmed."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Transfixing prey with the face-like pattern on its belly, it binds and poisons the frightened victim."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"With a very venge­ ful nature, it won't give up the chase, no matter how far, once it targets its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"To intimidate foes, it spreads its chest wide and makes eerie sounds by expelling air from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"This POKéMON is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once ARBOK wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once ARBOK wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON has a terrifically strong constricting power. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once it wraps its body around its foe, escaping is impossible."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The pattern on its belly appears to be a frightening face. Weak foes will flee just at the sight of the pattern."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is rumored that the ferocious warning markings on its belly differ from area to area."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Transfixing prey with the face-like pattern on its belly, it binds and poisons the frightened victim."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"With a very vengeful nature, it won’t give up the chase, no matter how far, once it targets its prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise la marque sur son ventre pour intimider l’ennemi. Il étouffe l’ennemi pétrifié par la peur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise la marque sur son ventre pour intimider l’ennemi. Il étouffe l’ennemi pétrifié par la peur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les motifs sur son corps ressemblent à un visage menaçant. Les adversaires les plus craintifs fuient à la seule vue de ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El dibujo que tiene en la panza aterroriza. Los rivales más débiles salen huyendo al verlo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The pattern on its belly appears to be a frightening face. Weak foes will flee just at the sight of the pattern."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お腹の 模様が 怖い 顔に 見える。 弱い 敵は その模様を 見ただけで 逃げ出してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour apeurer ses ennemis, il gonfle sa poitrine et émet d’étranges sons avec sa bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para intimidar a sus enemigos, hincha el pecho y echa aire por la boca emitiendo sonidos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"To intimidate foes, it spreads its chest wide and makes eerie sounds by expelling air from its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"胸を 広げ 威嚇するとき 口から 漏れる 空気の 音は 不気味で 相手を おびえさせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon doté d’une force extraordinaire peut étrangler ses proies avec son corps. Il peut même écraser des tonneaux métalliques. Une fois sous l’étreinte d’Arbok, il est impossible de lui échapper."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon es tremendamente fuerte, puede oprimir cualquier cosa con su cuerpo y hasta es capaz de estrujar un barril de acero. Una vez que Arbok se enrosca a su víctima, no hay forma de escapar de su asfixiante abrazo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once Arbok wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"締めつける 力は とても 強力。 ドラム缶も ぺしゃんこに してしまうぞ。 巻きつかれたら 逃げだす ことは 不可能だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon doté d’une force extraordinaire peut étrangler ses proies avec son corps. Il peut même écraser des tonneaux métalliques. Une fois sous l’étreinte d’Arbok, il est impossible de lui échapper."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Este Pokémon es tremendamente fuerte, puede oprimir cualquier cosa con su cuerpo y hasta es capaz de estrujar un barril de acero. Una vez que Arbok se enrosca a su víctima, no hay forma de escapar de su asfixiante abrazo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once Arbok wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"締めつける 力は とても 強力。 ドラム缶も ぺしゃんこに してしまうぞ。 巻きつかれたら 逃げだす ことは 不可能だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Une étude récente aurait recensé plus de vingt motifs différents pouvant orner le devant du capuchon des Arbok."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Recientes estudios han llegado a identificar hasta una veintena de patrones distintos que puede presentar el motivo de su cuello."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The latest research has determined that there are over 20 possible arrangements of the patterns on its stomach."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"最新の 研究で お腹の 模様は ２０種類 以上の パターンが あることが 判明。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il intimide sa proie grâce au motif situé sur le devant de son capuchon, puis l’enserre jusqu’à ce que son cœur cesse de battre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Tras confundir a su presa con el motivo de su cuerpo, se enrosca a su alrededor y la aferra, a la espera de que su pulso se detenga."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"After stunning its opponents with the pattern on its stomach, it quickly wraps them up in its body and waits for them to stop moving."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"お腹の 模様で ひるませると 素早く 身体で 締め上げて 相手の 鼓動が 止まるのを 待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Des études ont révélé que les marques effrayantes de son corps pouvaient former six motifs différents."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Se han llegado a identificar hasta seis variaciones distintas de los espeluznantes dibujos de su piel."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The frightening pattern